# Runtime artifacts of running the scripts in this directory (README.md) — a Chromium
# profile, pids, logs, the X authority cookie. Point --user-data-dir/XAUTHORITY outside the
# repo (e.g. an agent's own ~/agent-work/<name>) to avoid ever needing this, but ignore them
# here too as a safety net.
profile/
profile2/
*.pid
*.log
Xauthority
